      "serialized_row_index": 33,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "こんにちは。\n何かお悩みですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b1ee8389cef4be7fb440df918fdc159a17cd5b5fdc652dbca1c0022c445a3269",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あ、うむ……。\n我は姉上に対し、大罪を犯してしまったのだ……。\nその名は怠惰……。それ故に、姉妹の間には深淵の如き溝が……。",
      "jp_sha256": "74e75869ccb5af99743475bd8fb1688b638b9dfc3baa48539b0b09a3ea45b361",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아, 음…….\n나는 언니에게 큰 죄를 저지르고 말았다…….\n그 이름은 나태…… 그 때문에 자매 사이에 심연 같은 골이…….",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 35,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b51c6ecc6e9eb719daae95490ec9add7e525646e41f56f7566e9dee1087da2b8:000002_3425431854203047390:g0:r34",
      "row_index_0based": 34,
      "serialized_row_index": 34,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ティーレ",
        "Emt10_Sad",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "あ、うむ……。\n我は姉上に対し、大罪を犯してしまったのだ……。\nその名は怠惰……。それ故に、姉妹の間には深淵の如き溝が……。",
