      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "えー……っと？\nつまりティーレさんが何かをサボって、\n姉のレティアさんと喧嘩しちゃったってことですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "599db3c51d4a0283f1764c58b985b1624815c98c8ff46a68e930aea837b9d4b6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어―…… 그러니까요?\n티레 씨가 뭔가를 빼먹어서,\n언니인 레티아 씨와 싸웠다는 건가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 36,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b51c6ecc6e9eb719daae95490ec9add7e525646e41f56f7566e9dee1087da2b8:000002_3425431854203047390:g0:r35",
      "row_index_0based": 35,
      "serialized_row_index": 35,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "えー……っと？\nつまりティーレさんが何かをサボって、\n姉のレティアさんと喧嘩しちゃったってことですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3d7bdbb7450f57727ec7ff5b78405e067e566c8fb2e83d2f6620842e0195f965",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "その通りだ、契約者よ。\nここまで言えばわかるな？\nそう！　姉上との和解の儀に同行してくれ！",
      "jp_sha256": "59862a13fa8aab3f30a854652d6098babb4b3f4c8a8c8b328185e75fbe0e0377",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇다, 계약자여.\n여기까지 말했으면 알겠지?\n그래! 언니와 화해하는 의식에 동행해 줘!",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 37,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b51c6ecc6e9eb719daae95490ec9add7e525646e41f56f7566e9dee1087da2b8:000002_3425431854203047390:g0:r36",
      "row_index_0based": 36,
      "serialized_row_index": 36,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ティーレ",
        "Emt3_Gla",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "その通りだ、契約者よ。\nここまで言えばわかるな？\nそう！　姉上との和解の儀に同行してくれ！",
        "",
        "ch_10019/R18/10019B0_10019_Nml/10019B0_10019_003",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ティーレ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
